# Your own Tend login email.
TEND_EMAIL=

# --- Auth: set ONE of the two below ---
# Both are effectively as sensitive as a password (a refresh token can mint
# fresh sessions indefinitely without re-entering anything) -- treat them
# accordingly: never commit, never paste into a chat/ticket/log, rotate if
# you suspect either has leaked.

# Option A: your real Tend password. Logs in fresh on first use and captures
# a refresh token in memory for the rest of the process's lifetime (not
# written back to this file).
TEND_PASSWORD=

# Option B: a Cognito refresh token, obtained by hand from DevTools ->
# Application -> Cookies on hellotend.com (cookie named "refreshToken")
# while logged in. Skips login entirely. Reusable for a long time (not
# rotated on use here), but doesn't self-renew if it's ever revoked --
# TEND_PASSWORD is used as a fallback if both are set and this expires.
TEND_REFRESH_TOKEN=
